<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0A1020', fontFamily: 'Arial', padding: '52px 60px 30px 60px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4D8DFF', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2.2 }}>09 · LIMITS AND NEXT STEPS</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 8 }}>
        What is still open, and what we would do next
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#24334C', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#A8B8CE', marginTop: 12, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
        Ordered by benefit ÷ cost. Items 02 and 03 are analysis and re-registration only; item 01 is a new experiment, about 2–3 GPU-hours.
    </Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 44, marginTop: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#FF6B6B', letterSpacing: 1.4, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>LIMITS WE DID NOT HIDE</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 8 }}>
                {[
                    ['01', 'Tuning is asymmetric', 'A2 was tuned 30 times, A3 never. Part of the negative Λ may be tuning, not chain harm.'],
                    ['02', 'The slope lives in the amplified region', '23 of 40 scaling cells have a denominator below 0.05; the sign there is a ratio effect.'],
                    ['03', 'Tier 3 cannot be matched upward', '228 / 279 rows are too few to lift to tier 1 — the confound is solved for t1 vs t2 only.'],
                    ['04', 'One label source', '6 of 6 main tasks are experimental, so cross-source τ is not evaluable.'],
                ].map(([num, head, body], i) => (
                    <Box key={num} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, borderTop: i === 0 ? '0px solid #1D2A40' : '1px solid #1D2A40' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#93A8C2', width: 22, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>{num}</Text>
                        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>{head}</Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#A8B8CE', marginTop: 3, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>{body}</Text>
                        </Box>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1, background: '#24334C' }} />

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4D8DFF', letterSpacing: 1.4, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>WHAT WE WOULD DO NEXT</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 8 }}>
                {[
                    ['01', 'Give A3 the same 30-trial budget', 'Directly tests the weakest assumption behind the first conclusion.'],
                    ['02', 'Pre-register H2′ as its own hypothesis', 'Both rulers under one protocol, "halved" defined separately for each.'],
                    ['03', 'Re-rank H1 on a continuous axis', 'A2\'s own R² or n-bins instead of three discrete tiers — is the break the label or the difficulty?'],
                    ['04', 'Add a second label source', 'DFT or MD labels would make the source-heterogeneity clause testable.'],
                ].map(([num, head, body], i) => (
                    <Box key={num} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, borderTop: i === 0 ? '0px solid #1D2A40' : '1px solid #1D2A40' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4D8DFF', width: 22, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>{num}</Text>
                        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>{head}</Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#A8B8CE', marginTop: 3, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>{body}</Text>
                        </Box>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', marginTop: 'auto' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA3BC' }}>Group 32 · How Much Is a Chain Worth?</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA3BC' }}>16 / 18</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
